    <h1>Privacy <em>Policy.</em></h1>
    <p class="clearwater-lead">Last updated April 2026. Three generations of the Kovac family handle your data the way we'd want ours handled. We collect what we need to do the work, we don't sell it, and we never sign you up for marketing without asking.</p>
