<section class="clearwater-section clearwater-section--cream-deep">
  <div class="clearwater-container clearwater-container--narrow">
    <div class="clearwater-prose">
      <h2>What we collect.</h2>
      <p>When you call or book online, Tess records: your name, phone, email, service address, and what's wrong. During the service call our plumber adds: photos of the issue, equipment make and model, parts used, and what was done. For repipes and remodels, we add scope drawings, permit records, and inspector sign-off documents.</p>
      <p>The site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for privacy-respecting page-view counting. No cookies, no fingerprinting, no third-party trackers.</p>

      <h2>What we use it for.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To dispatch the right plumber.</li>
        <li>To send you the estimate and invoice.</li>
        <li>To pull permits when the job requires one.</li>
        <li>To honor the one-year warranty on every install.</li>
        <li>To remind you about maintenance plan visits (if you're on the plan).</li>
        <li>To send a single review-request email after the job is closed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sell your information.</li>
        <li>Add you to a marketing list without your explicit opt-in.</li>
        <li>Share your address with manufacturers, parts suppliers, or third parties beyond what's required for warranty registration.</li>
        <li>Run advertising trackers, retargeting pixels, or behavioral analytics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it.</h2>
      <p>Job records are retained for 7 years per Utah state plumbing license requirements. Service-call notes are kept 5 years. Maintenance-plan customer records are kept while the plan is active and for 3 years after cancellation. Site analytics are aggregated after 30 days.</p>

      <h2>Your rights.</h2>
      <p>You can ask for a copy of any data we hold, ask us to correct it, or ask for deletion (subject to the retention windows above). Email <a href="mailto:hello@clearwaterslc.example">hello@clearwaterslc.example</a> with subject "Privacy" and Tess will respond within 10 business days.</p>

      <h2>Contact.</h2>
      <p>Clearwater Plumbing, 948 South State Street, Salt Lake City, UT 84111. <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
